<%= content_for :title, "New version" %>

<header class="header">
  <h1><%= link_to @profile.botanical_name, madmin_library_profile_path(@profile) %> / New version</h1>
</header>

<p>Starts from the latest version. Saving makes a draft; the published version stays until this one is published.</p>

